WEBVTT

00:03:28.287 --> 00:03:33.793
And local governments generally manage
the infrastructure of pollution.

00:03:34.502 --> 00:03:39.173
But in smaller cities and rural areas,
industrial and oil refineries,

00:03:39.173 --> 00:03:42.718
landfills and incinerators,
they're usually the problem.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.513
And in places like Texas and California,

00:03:45.554 --> 00:03:48.224
there may be no zoning laws

00:03:48.266 --> 00:03:53.312
that separate industrial facilities
from residential backyards.

00:03:53.938 --> 00:03:56.232
So environmental racism and injustice

00:03:56.232 --> 00:04:00.945
results from a complex legacy
of housing segregation,